@startuml
title Licence state machine (LIC-020..022, LIC-005)
[*] --> Unlicensed
Unlicensed --> Trial : start trial (30 days)
Unlicensed --> Active : import .hclic / QR / key
Trial --> Active : import licence
Trial --> ReadOnly : trial ends
Active --> Active : renew (import new .hclic)
Active --> Grace : valid_until passed
Grace --> Active : renew
Grace --> ReadOnly : 15 days passed
ReadOnly --> Active : renew / activate
Active --> Revoked : MVP2 only: refresh says revoked
Revoked --> ReadOnly
state Tampered : signature or identity check\nfails twice (SUX-005)
Active --> Tampered
Tampered --> Active : Repair / re-import .hclic
Tampered --> ReadOnly
state ReadOnly : view, search, print, export ALLOWED\nnew visit / Rx / bill BLOCKED
state Active : all entitled features
note right of Active
  Clock guard: expiry checked against
  max(now, last_seen - 48h)
end note
@enduml
